
menu "Display Test Demo"
    config DISPLAY_TEST_DEMO
        bool "Run native LCD test instead of LVGL"
        default n
        help
            Loop red, green, blue, white, 16 grayscale bands and
            an optional image, one second each. Touch and LVGL are not started.
            Grayscale bands are vertical on landscape panels and horizontal
            on portrait panels, determined by the selected panel resolution.
            Put test.png, test.jpg or test.bmp in main/images before building.
endmenu
